---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = 'June 2025';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use — Tech To Empower"
  description="The terms governing your use of the Tech To Empower website."
>
  <section class="legal section">
    <div class="container legal__inner">
      <header class="legal__head" data-reveal-group>
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--muted reveal">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="legal__title reveal">Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="legal__updated reveal">Last updated: {updated}</p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal__body">
        <p>
          Welcome to the Tech To Empower (&ldquo;TTE&rdquo;) website. By using this site, you
          agree to these terms. TTE is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization, and this site
          exists to share our work and accept support for it.
        </p>

        <h2>Use of the site</h2>
        <p>
          You may view, share, and link to our content for personal and informational
          purposes. Please don&rsquo;t use the site in any way that is unlawful, disrupts its
          operation, or misrepresents your affiliation with TTE.
        </p>

        <h2>Donations</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Donations are processed securely through Square. By donating, you agree to
            Square&rsquo;s terms in addition to ours.
          </li>
          <li>
            TTE is a registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit; donations are tax-deductible to the
            extent allowed by law. You will receive a receipt for your records.
          </li>
          <li>
            Donations are voluntary gifts. If you believe a donation was made in error,
            contact us and we will work with you in good faith.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          The Tech To Empower name, logo, and original content on this site belong to TTE.
          Photographs of students and programs are shared with permission and remain the
          property of their respective owners. Please don&rsquo;t reuse them without asking.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          Our site may link to external services such as Square or Instagram. We are not
          responsible for the content or practices of sites we don&rsquo;t operate.
        </p>

        <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          This site is provided &ldquo;as is.&rdquo; While we work to keep information
          accurate and current, we make no warranties about its completeness. Program
          statistics describe past activity and are not guarantees of future outcomes.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after
          changes are posted means you accept the revised terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms? Reach us on Instagram at
          <a href="https://instagram.com/tech_to_empower" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            @tech_to_empower</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal__inner {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .legal {
    padding-top: calc(76px + var(--space-section));
  }
  .legal__head {
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 2vw, 3rem);
  }
  .legal__title {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .legal__updated {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .legal__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .legal__body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }
  .legal__body ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }
  .legal__body a {
    color: var(--navy-mid);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .legal__body a:hover {
    color: var(--sky);
  }
</style>
